        <div class="hero-text">
            <span class="tag">BIG ELECTRONICS SALE</span>
            <h2>Upgrade Your Tech Life!</h2>
            <p>Discover the latest laptops, smartphones,
               accessories and smart devices at great prices.</p>
            <a href="#products" class="btn">Explore Products</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498049794561-7780e7231661?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
