            <p>Memory: 16GB RAM</p>
            <p>Storage: 512GB SSD</p>
            <p>Display: Full HD (model dependent)</p>
            <p>Listed Price: ₹59,999</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-box" id="mac-details">
            <h3>MacBook Air</h3>
            <p>Category: Laptop</p>
            <p>Processor: Apple Chip</p>
            <p>Memory: 16GB RAM</p>
            <p>Storage: 256GB SSD</p>
            <p>Listed Price: ₹89,999</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-box" id="samsung-details">
            <h3>Samsung Galaxy</h3>
            <p>Category: Smartphone</p>
            <p>Memory: 8GB RAM</p>
            <p>Storage: 256GB</p>
            <p>Network: 5G</p>
